abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Digital Judiciary architecture for governed
  precedent in software-change adjudication; five executed 6,000-case
  simulation corpora (simulation pack 2.4.0, corpus data 2.1.0) with constitutions, reference
  adjudicator, conformance suites and mutation matrices; and the benchmark
  harness comparing governed precedent against monolithic per-case reasoning
  and a priced human review desk; and, since 5.16.0, the Enterprise Conscience
  fast track (tiered canon, dispensation-token registry, conscience gate,
  examen log) coupled to the judiciary through a bench, with its 365-day
  five-company driver, conformance suite, mutation matrix and preregistration.
  Code Apache-2.0; corpora, constitutions, canons and documents CC BY 4.0.
